post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'

HW Glance is installed. Nothing is enabled yet. Run, as your normal user:

  systemctl --user enable --now hwglanced

Optional, for CPU package power and memory speed (they need root to read):

  sudo systemctl enable --now hwglance-helper

On the Omarchy desktop, add the bar widget:

  hwglance-bar-widget install

Then start HW Glance from your launcher or with `hwglance`.
MSG
}

post_upgrade() {
  cat <<'MSG'

HW Glance was upgraded. To use the new version, run as your normal user:

  systemctl --user restart hwglanced
  hwglance-bar-widget update

and, if you use the root helper:

  sudo systemctl restart hwglance-helper

MSG
}
